   "text": "Auto run only: agent comment, one proposed learning\nper `learning:` line, child tasks per `spawn:` line.\nThen, only if the task is running:\n pending comments: todo   |   status done: review\n status failed: todo (failed at the limit)\n no block: needs_you",
